<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italian 3-yr BTP auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italian 3-yr BTP auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTPs) with a 6.00 percent coupon, and a seventh tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 6.25 percent five-year BTPs.</p>
<p>		   May 15, 2000   pvs	May 15, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	  5.14 pct    5.12	  5.20 pct    5.27</p>
<p> Gross Yield	5.92 pct    5.90	  6.04 pct    6.12</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.40	100.45	101.20	100.90</p>
<p> Bids		3.555 trln lire	   3.096 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	  2.000 trln lire	   2.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction on June 30.</p>
</text>
